The Anthropic API returned HTTP <%= @status_code %> while reviewing a signup.

<% if @status_code == "429" %>
This usually means the account is out of credits or rate-limited.
Please top up API credits at https://console.anthropic.com
<% else %>
This usually means the API key is invalid or expired.
Please check the anthropic_api_key in the server config.
<% end %>

Until this is resolved, new signups will be flagged for manual review.
